{"title": "COMBINED 日志生成 HTML 报告（Debian 12 实测）", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "goaccess /tmp/access.log --log-format=COMBINED \\"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "  -o report.html"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "ls -lh report.html"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 346K report.html"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "grep -oE '\"valid_requests\": [0-9]+' report.json"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "\"valid_requests\": 5"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "自造 5 条 combined 测试日志，全部解析进报告"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：debian:12 容器，GoAccess 1.7"}
]}
